        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rectangular straw bale, baling and loading bales</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rectangular straw bale, baling and loading bales
na;
UUID: 1dffb1b6-8264-3d87-960f-29b4c3c1e20b
&lt;null&gt;
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: rectangular straw bale for construction as prepared at farm/plant and to be further used in building sites with straw ball walls
Time period: 2010 and after
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from farmers in Switzerland using specific machines/engines for parallelepipedic baling. 2 kinds of baling were takien into account, a small size baling (approx. 100*45*40cm) and a large size baling (250*80*90cm).
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1dffb1b6-8264-3d87-960f-29b4c3c1e20b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
